Package: myceliumr
Title: Cross-Species Cohort Framework for Genomics Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
      person("Samuel", "Bharti", , "samuelbharti.io@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: A lightweight R package for managing cross-species study data
    and analysis artifacts. Provides S7 classes for rat/mouse/human cohorts
    with manifest validation, ortholog-aware annotation support, and
    standardized storage for WES and snRNA-seq outputs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: http://www.samuelbharti.com/myceliumr/, https://github.com/samuelbharti/myceliumr
BugReports: https://github.com/samuelbharti/myceliumr/issues
